  "description": "It's Electric! The new 26in Hyper Jet Fuel E-Ride BMX E-Bike is a fun alternative mash up of an electric pedal assistance motor with an all around 26in BMX platform. This electric BMX bike is truly a fun alternative to the ordinary especially with our signature Hyper Jet Fuel finish frame and parts. This Hyper electric BMX bike is ready to ride bike parks, around town, commute, and bike trials. We have equipped this electric BMX bike with 26in multi-surfaced fat tires for extra traction, comfort, and control. The 36V battery is flush mounted to the frame and works seamlessly with the rear hub electric motor and hand controls. Plug in the provided battery charger and in 4 hours you will be fully charged and ready for another 20 miles of electric pedal assisted riding. The all new 26in Hyper Jet Fuel E-Ride BMX is electric and ready to roll!",
